\pard\b\fs20 Swamp of Death\b0\par
\fs16\par
In the swamp between Kaldor and the Council of Cra-Kla-Zoth lives a necromancer. He uses the many bog bodies the swamp has collected to build himself an army of undead. But the Order of Sawel\'f4 cannot allow Meduvia to be overrun by the undead in the end. So the order decides to cleanse the swamp.\par
The goal is to take all the sanctuaries one after the other. To capture one, you have to throw 5 holigon onto it. Equipment can be bought at your own sanctuary. You get the money for it by killing skeletons. But when you die, a third of your money is deducted.\par
To master the onslaught of skeletons, you can put up buildings:\par
- The magic tower shoots lightning at skeletons (but not at trolls!)\par
- The altar damages all enemies nearby.\par
- Statues slow the skeletons down.\par
- Towers can block the enemies.\par
Buildings can also be repaired with a construction kit, and later upgraded as well.\par
